  "description": "Meet your travel companion With so many places to go, you need a ride powerful enough to keep up and compact enough to take along. The Discovery X6 Folding Electric Bicycle is built to make every ride easier. Cruise comfortably with pedal assist, pick up extra speed with the twist throttle, and fold it down in seconds for easy storage wherever life takes you. Plus, a more powerful 48V, 7.5Ah EVE2600 battery helps you go farther with confidence. 3 levels of pedal assist The Discovery X6 is designed to make every ride effortless. Turn it on and choose from 3 levels of pedal assist — level 1 gives you a light boost, while level 3 delivers the most assistance. Just choose your level, start pedaling, and let the motor do the hard work. Compact folding design with secure magnetic closure The easy folding system and collapsible handlebars make the Discovery X6 compact and convenient for everyday life. A built-in magnetic closure helps keep the bike securely folded, so you can transport and store it with confidence. Integrated lights for added visibility Ride with added confidence thanks to a sleek in-frame headlight and integrated brake lights that help improve visibility on the road while keeping the bike's design clean and streamlined. LCD display A smartly placed LCD display shows your speed, distance traveled, pedal assist level, and battery life in a clean, easy-to-read design.",
